<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts 3 pipeline shares.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts 3 pipeline shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of three Canadian natural gas pipeline companies.</p>
<p>-- added TransCanada PipeLines Ltd to firm's recommended list.</p>
<p>-- rated NOVA Corp market outperform.</p>
<p>-- rated Westcoast Energy Inc market outperform.</p>
</text>
